Package: cst
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: openssl
Description: NXP Code Signing Tool for QorIQ and Layerscape secure boot
 CST generates the RSA key pairs, CSF headers and signatures used by the
 secure boot flow of NXP QorIQ and Layerscape processors: ISBC and ESBC
 headers, PBI/RCW signing, CF headers for non-PBL devices, OTPMK and
 debug response values, and fuse provisioning scripts.
 .
 The sample input files and the per-platform signing scripts are installed
 under /usr/share/cst.
